sequenceDiagram
    participant Gen as Synthetic Generator
    participant Sites as Source Sites (DMZ)
    participant API as wolverine-api
    participant MinIO as MinIO (Raw Store)
    participant PG as postgres-wdb
    participant Redis as Redis (Pub/Sub)
    participant ER as entity-resolver
    participant GP as graph-projector
    participant Neo as Neo4j
    participant Ollama as Ollama (LLM)
    participant UI as Analyst UI

    Gen->>Sites: Seed synthetic data (50K personas)
    API->>Sites: GET /api/... (collect payloads)
    API->>MinIO: Store raw bytes (immutable)
    API->>API: Parse → CanonicalRecord
    API->>PG: INSERT canonical record
    API->>Redis: Publish RecordNormalizedEvent
    Redis->>ER: Consume event
    ER->>PG: Fetch candidates (blocking keys)
    ER->>ER: Compute Jaro-Winkler scores
    ER->>PG: INSERT ResolutionCandidate
    Redis->>GP: Consume linkage event  
    GP->>PG: Fetch linked pairs
    GP->>GP: Build adjacency map
    GP->>Neo: Upsert GraphNode/GraphEdge
    UI->>API: GET /v1/graph/query
    API->>Neo: BFS traversal
    Neo-->>API: Subgraph
    API-->>UI: JSON response
    UI->>API: POST /v1/analysis/questions
    API->>API: Sanitize context (4 rules)
    API->>Ollama: POST /api/generate
    alt LLM responds
        Ollama-->>API: Generated narrative
    else LLM timeout (>5s)
        API->>API: Deterministic fallback
    end
    API-->>UI: Narrative response
